### Check one email
GET https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify?email=jane.doe@acmecorp.com

### Check one email (POST)
POST https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "sam.lee@gmial.com" }

### Check a batch (up to 50 without a key, 500 with one)
POST https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/verify/batch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR-API-KEY

{ "emails": ["jane.doe@acmecorp.com", "hello@mailinator.com", "info@github.com"] }

### Check a domain
GET https://YOUR-API-ADDRESS/v1/domain?domain=acmecorp.com
